    {
      "subId": "4112308",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Timid Morrow",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411230801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411230801": {
            "id": "411230801",
            "speakerId": 1575,
            "speakerName": "Timid Morrow",
            "text": "Huh? It's you, again? What were you doing this whole time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411230802"
            ]
          },
          "411230802": {
            "id": "411230802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Defeating all the monsters?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411230803"
            ]
          },
          "411230803": {
            "id": "411230803",
            "speakerId": 1575,
            "speakerName": "Timid Morrow",
            "text": "Defeating all the... What? Just you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411230804"
            ]
          },
          "411230804": {
            "id": "411230804",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You can go check it out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411230805"
            ]
          },
          "411230805": {
            "id": "411230805",
            "speakerId": 1575,
            "speakerName": "Timid Morrow",
            "text": "Ugh, I daren't look. If they see me, I'd be done for!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411230806"
            ]
          },
          "411230806": {
            "id": "411230806",
            "speakerId": 1575,
            "speakerName": "Timid Morrow",
            "text": "I'll just report what you've said to the Knights — never mind if it's true or not.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411230807"
            ]
          },
          "411230807": {
            "id": "411230807",
            "speakerId": 1575,
            "speakerName": "Timid Morrow",
            "text": "Th—They'll have some way to check if you've beaten all those monsters, I'm sure."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112309",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Huffman",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411230901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411230901": {
            "id": "411230901",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "How's the situation?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411230902"
            ]
          },
          "411230902": {
            "id": "411230902",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Springvale is safe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411230903"
            ]
          },
          "411230903": {
            "id": "411230903",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "That's great... I was honestly worried that we might not be able to spare anyone to help out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411230904"
            ]
          },
          "411230904": {
            "id": "411230904",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Thank you so much. You've really helped us out this time. Please take these as a token of our esteem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411230905"
            ]
          },
          "411230905": {
            "id": "411230905",
            "speakerId": 1433,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "*sigh* Meteorites, monsters... I can only hope that nothing truly messy happens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112311",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411231101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411231101": {
            "id": "411231101",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "How do you do, Honorary Knight? Please, do your utmost to remain within the city limits during this time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411231102"
            ]
          },
          "411231102": {
            "id": "411231102",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Now, I believe that you've seen those fallen meteorites as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411231103"
            ]
          },
          "411231103": {
            "id": "411231103",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "For some reason, they've started falling at a greater rate than before, and it's become more dangerous out there in the wild.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411231104"
            ]
          },
          "411231104": {
            "id": "411231104",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "All sorts of matters are cropping up within the city, almost more than the Knights can handle. All this, at a time when we'd just discovered Treasure Hoarder activity near the city...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411231105"
            ]
          },
          "411231105": {
            "id": "411231105",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Those fellows would do anything for a little Mora. I fear that they'll try to take advantage of this situation...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411231106"
            ]
          },
          "411231106": {
            "id": "411231106",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "If you're willing, Traveler, could you help us chase those thieves off?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411231108",
              "411231110"
            ]
          },
          "411231108": {
            "id": "411231108",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Spoken well, Honorary Knight. I'll leave it in your able hands."
          },
          "411231110": {
            "id": "411231110",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Hmph. I'd wager that those crooks fear nothing, as long as they can get their hands on some Mora.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411231111"
            ]
          },
          "411231111": {
            "id": "411231111",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "You have my thanks. I'm sorry, I know it reflects ill on us to be asking for your help in such circumstances."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112351",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411235101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411235101": {
            "id": "411235101",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "I suppose it can be considered some small consolation that no meteorites have come down within the city walls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112353",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411235301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411235301": {
            "id": "411235301",
            "speakerId": 1218,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Meteorites, monsters and the Treasure Hoarders. It's really pouring, isn't it..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112354",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411235401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411235401": {
            "id": "411235401",
            "speakerId": 1575,
            "speakerName": "Timid Morrow",
            "text": "I have to warn everyone..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4112358",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411235801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411235801": {
            "id": "411235801",
            "speakerId": 1575,
            "speakerName": "Timid Morrow",
            "text": "Did you really defeat all those monsters by yourself?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411235802"
            ]
          },
          "411235802": {
            "id": "411235802",
            "speakerId": 1575,
            "speakerName": "Timid Morrow",
            "text": "If that's so, you're really strong. Better than the Knights of Favonius, even."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}